---
title: "check_price_is_fresh (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_calc_age: age = abs_diff(clock_ms/1000, price_timestamp)
    q_calc_age --> q_check: age < max_age_secs
    q_check --> [*]: true, return (no abort)
    q_check --> q_abort: false, abort E_STALE_PRICE_UPDATE

    note right of q_calc_age
        INV-001: uses absolute difference to handle clock skew
        INV-002: clock timestamp is divided by 1000 (ms to seconds conversion)
        INV-003: staleness check uses strict less-than comparison
    end note
